# CR 702.18a, 115.10a: shroud stops only targeting. Fiery Confluence's "2 damage to each opponent" chooses no target, so
# it reaches True Believer's controller. Bot1 casts True Believer on turn 1; on turn 2 Bot2's Lightning Bolt can't target
# Bot1 (refusal, with the red mana to cast it; the positive control is the Bolt at Bot1 once True Believer is gone, in
# true-believer-gives-its-controller-shroud-against-every-spell-their-own-included), but Fiery Confluence with its second
# mode three times deals Bot1 6 damage.

